00:09:36.933 --> 00:09:37.966
Udah lama ya kita nggak ketemu.

00:09:39.166 --> 00:09:40.166
Hah?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:41.700
Ha?

00:09:49.033 --> 00:09:50.033
